@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
title POST /api/workspace/v1/messenger/folder_items/{folder_item_uuid}/actions/unpin/invoke
actor "Клиент" as Client
participant "Контроллер RestAlchemy" as API
database "PostgreSQL\nFOLDER_ITEM + привязки контейнеров" as DB
queue "Транзакционный outbox" as OUT
queue "Типизированная задача проекции папки" as TASK
participant "Пул воркеров" as WORKER
database "Хранилище публичных событий" as EVENT
participant "Диспетчер WebSocket" as DISP
participant "Подписанный клиент" as WS
Client -> API: POST открепления (без тела)
note right of API
  Меняется слой размещения (placement), не автоматическое правило/членство.
  Проекция: активная USER_STREAM_BINDING + каноническая STREAM.is_archived = false.
  All chats = все; Personal = STREAM.private = true; Channels = STREAM.private = false.
end note
API -> DB: BEGIN; заблокировать элемент в заданной области
API -> DB: установить pinned_at = NULL
API -> OUT: добавить folder_item.unpin
API -> DB: COMMIT
API --> Client: 200 JSON элемента
OUT -> TASK: immutable folder_projection(outbox_event_uuid)\nscope=user-folder; без coalescing
TASK -> WORKER: claim user-folder(project,user,folder)\nlease + fencing
WORKER -> DB: прочитать normalized items + ready stream counts
group одна worker DB transaction
  WORKER -> DB: replace deterministic snapshot + counts\nversion/updated_at
  WORKER -> EVENT: ready folder.updated + unique effect guard
end
DISP -> EVENT: читать/повторять/воспроизводить
DISP -> WS: folder.updated
@enduml
